title: seesaw-tgg
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the
  paper it implements.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sandra Theresa
    family-names: Keßler
    email: mail@sandra-kessler.net
repository-code: https://github.com/zero-objects/seesaw
license: Apache-2.0
version: 2.0.2
abstract: >-
  A bidirectional graph transformation engine for Triple Graph
  Grammars with a declarative, purely positive rule format.
  Identity is structural, connections are anonymous, and the
  cascade is delta-local in both directions.
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    seesaw: Delta-extended Triple Graph Grammars with Constructive
    Termination, Irredundant Consolidation, and Non-destructive
    History
  authors:
    - given-names: Sandra Theresa
      family-names: Keßler
      email: mail@sandra-kessler.net
    - given-names: Thomas
      family-names: Maier
